{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Donut Riders",
    "steam_appid": 3675150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/ed13c20cc731171240241342c63d6339.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=193 /></span><br><strong>Donut Riders</strong> is an exciting racing and combat game where you customize your favorite donut and send it speeding through chaotic, destructible tracks, open worlds where no race is ever the same, and arenas for epic battles. Collect power-ups, attack, and defend yourself with awesome dual-function weapons. Are you ready to chase down a sweet victory?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/5a279f574f1026aef173428511a2e95c.avif?t=1753507440\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the greatest franchises of the \u201980s and \u201990s, <strong>Donut Riders</strong> pays homage to the golden era of video games. Create your donut and customize it however you want to turn it into a true <i>Ronnie</i>. Over 50 accessories available right from launch! Switch up your <i>Ronnie\u2019s</i> skin, visor, and add unique touches like hair, hats, glasses, axes, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/98cdbb5dc580227cc66adc5144a80b42.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=457 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/ca801258c07fbd243dda5f26c30dac2b.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re guaranteed non-stop fun and epic showdowns, whether you play solo, with family, or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/36053e66c4a0533f121daab05adca657.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=457 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/14d2bca879fd225a9575c28ca4a657f6.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Donut Rush:</strong> Feel the freedom of this out-of-the-ordinary open-world race! Gather power-ups before the competition kicks off, jump off track, discover hidden routes, and be the first to reach three random checkpoints as they pop up along the way. Think you\u2019ve mastered a track? Think again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/b8bcef0065c7d1f737fffb4adb2ca141.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Battle Mode:</strong> Face off against your friends in trap-filled, obstacle-packed arenas. Attack, defend, and be the last Ronnie standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/caf3e6fb221313cca7109935cf6facb5.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Minigames:</strong> A variety of quick, fun challenges that will test your speed, reflexes, aim, or endurance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/5cf67f4a0f7508a316c6aab82c5ddd2b.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=196 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-ups are dual-purpose weapons for both offense and defense.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the Nova Cannon fires killer missiles but also lets you boost yourself, escape through the air, or reach far-off zones that give you the edge over everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/30174118765b730e65e61df2012f06b2.avif?t=1753507440\" data-has-big width=800 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out Fire Ronnie or Zombie Ronnie, but don\u2019t let the sugary looks of Unicorn Ronnie, Classic Ronnie, or Chef Ronnie fool you\u2014they can all surprise you with a slime attack, a missile, a landmine, or a perfectly timed knockout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Donut Riders</strong>, revenge is sweet; if you get knocked out of the race, you can come back from beyond to get even. So\u2026 are you ready to claim your sweet victory?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/ed13c20cc731171240241342c63d6339.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=193 /></span><br><strong>Donut Riders</strong> is an exciting racing and combat game where you customize your favorite donut and send it speeding through chaotic, destructible tracks, open worlds where no race is ever the same, and arenas for epic battles. Collect power-ups, attack, and defend yourself with awesome dual-function weapons. Are you ready to chase down a sweet victory?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/5a279f574f1026aef173428511a2e95c.avif?t=1753507440\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the greatest franchises of the \u201980s and \u201990s, <strong>Donut Riders</strong> pays homage to the golden era of video games. Create your donut and customize it however you want to turn it into a true <i>Ronnie</i>. Over 50 accessories available right from launch! Switch up your <i>Ronnie\u2019s</i> skin, visor, and add unique touches like hair, hats, glasses, axes, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/98cdbb5dc580227cc66adc5144a80b42.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=457 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/ca801258c07fbd243dda5f26c30dac2b.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re guaranteed non-stop fun and epic showdowns, whether you play solo, with family, or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/36053e66c4a0533f121daab05adca657.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=457 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/14d2bca879fd225a9575c28ca4a657f6.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Donut Rush:</strong> Feel the freedom of this out-of-the-ordinary open-world race! Gather power-ups before the competition kicks off, jump off track, discover hidden routes, and be the first to reach three random checkpoints as they pop up along the way. Think you\u2019ve mastered a track? Think again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/b8bcef0065c7d1f737fffb4adb2ca141.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Battle Mode:</strong> Face off against your friends in trap-filled, obstacle-packed arenas. Attack, defend, and be the last Ronnie standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/caf3e6fb221313cca7109935cf6facb5.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Minigames:</strong> A variety of quick, fun challenges that will test your speed, reflexes, aim, or endurance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/5cf67f4a0f7508a316c6aab82c5ddd2b.avif?t=1753507440\" width=800 height=196 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-ups are dual-purpose weapons for both offense and defense.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the Nova Cannon fires killer missiles but also lets you boost yourself, escape through the air, or reach far-off zones that give you the edge over everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675150/extras/30174118765b730e65e61df2012f06b2.avif?t=1753507440\" data-has-big width=800 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out Fire Ronnie or Zombie Ronnie, but don\u2019t let the sugary looks of Unicorn Ronnie, Classic Ronnie, or Chef Ronnie fool you\u2014they can all surprise you with a slime attack, a missile, a landmine, or a perfectly timed knockout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Donut Riders</strong>, revenge is sweet; if you get knocked out of the race, you can come back from beyond to get even. So\u2026 are you ready to claim your sweet victory?</p>",
